derio è quello di vivere."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In a remote South American colony in the late 18th century, officer Zama of the Spanish crown waits in vain for a transfer to a more prestigious location. He suffers small humiliations and petty politicking as he increasingly succumbs to lust and paranoia."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Narra la historia de Don Diego de Zama, un oficial español del siglo XVII asentado en Asunción que espera su transferencia a Buenos Aires. Es un hombre que espera ser reconocido por sus méritos. Pero en los años de espera pierde todo. Decide atrapar un peligroso bandido y recuperar su nombre... Basada en la novela existencial de Antonio Di Benedetto escrita en 1956."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3pfgZyIJ1AyXD4JB6b0d2IHzTLV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9JqIR7bBO0uofsJiONgYAX2yw1R.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":326382,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kpp9R6iYKSIXxfyW0feVYrk0jsg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kpp9R6iYKSIXxfyW0feVYrk0jsg.jpg","language":"en","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kpp9R6iYKSIXxfyW0feVYrk0jsg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kpp9R6iYKSIXxfyW0feVYrk0jsg.jpg","language":"en","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iH6n5qf39yovkkZeSekYEySWHn3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iH6n5qf39yovkkZeSekYEySWHn3.jpg","language":"en","width":784,"height":1176},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pJgk30ERHA5ggCRBmbTHzt3vvv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1pJgk30ERHA5ggCRBmbTHzt3vv